{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/862361-3d-printed-cofd","id":862361,"title":"3D printed CofD","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-08T19:19:17-07:00","id":862361,"title":"3D printed CofD","content":"I'm lucky enough to have a job where I get to play around with a 3D printer and design random models to help push the limits of what we can do with the technology. That means some of the stuff I create are the bizarre creatures of the Chronicles of Darkness. If you have any .stl, .obj, or other files on Thingiverse or similar sites, please share them here and I will index them in the first post. I'm hoping that as printers get more common, there will be more people who will be willing sharing their designs so everyone can use them in their games.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Second Chances</b></u><br /> <br /> <i>Amkhata</i><br /> <b>Herasu </b><b>Sabxent</b> (Greater) <a href=\"http://www.thingiverse.com/thing:1479006\" target=\"_blank\">1</a><br /> <b>The Husk </b>(Unique) <a href=\"http://www.thingiverse.com/thing:1480640\" target=\"_blank\">1</a><br /> <b>Sabasu Textant </b> (Greater) <a href=\"http://www.thingiverse.com/thing:1479570\" target=\"_blank\">1</a><br /> <b>Serpete</b><b> Penas</b> (Unique) <a href=\"http://www.thingiverse.com/thing:2305371\" target=\"_blank\">1 </a><br /> <b>Tetasu</b><b> Peh</b> (Greater) <a href=\"http://www.thingiverse.com/thing:1479622\" target=\"_blank\">1</a><br /> <br /> <i>God-Machine Minions</i><br /> <b>Arachnid Robot</b> <a href=\"http://www.thingiverse.com/thing:1368254\" target=\"_blank\">1</a><br /> <br /> <i>Horrors</i><br /> <b>Al-</b><b>miraj</b><a href=\"http://www.thingiverse.com/thing:1403867\" target=\"_blank\">1</a><br /> <b>Flying Piranha </b><a href=\"http://www.thingiverse.com/thing:1379249\" target=\"_blank\">1</a><br /> <b>Jaguar of Smoke and Mirrors </b><a hr