ad. The <a href=\"http://www.thingiverse.com/thing:1368254\" target=\"_blank\">Arachnid Robot</a> is straight up Pathfinder, but it works well as a God-Machine Minion too, so I'm tossing it in. I love this design, because unlike the others, I made it myself from scratch in Tinkercad, and it came out exactly like the illustration I based it on. I've also added my first Pandoran, the <a href=\"http://www.thingiverse.com/thing:1494373\" target=\"_blank\">Dust Devil</a>, specifically one using the Arid Dicorporation Transmution to take the form of a whirlwind. If Promethean isn't your thing, you can use it as a ghost too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T22:02:54-07:00","id":867373,"title":"","content":"Two more, both from Dark Eras. In the high weirdness of the Aztec, the <a href=\"http://www.thingiverse.com/thing:1498824\" target=\"_blank\">Jaguar of Smoke and Mirrors</a> hunts its prey. In 1970s New York, <a href=\"http://www.thingiverse.com/thing:1498851\" target=\"_blank\">Shabu spirits</a> drive werewolves and junkies alike to indulge in whatever their vices are.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-18T20:46:04-07:00","id":989700,"title":"","content":"It has been quite a while, but I have some more models to post. First is a generalized chainsaw spirit, the <a href=\"http://www.thingiverse.com/thing:1835813\" target=\"_blank\">Kar Kar Sum</a> from the Book of Spirits. My design is more of a caricature than the Kar Kar Sum illustration, but I like the dissonance that creates. I'll keep my eye out for other base models that may more and will likely post more versions of this spirit. <br /> Turning our attention to The Pack, one of the featured totems in that book is <a href=\"http://www.thingiverse.com/thing:1833341\" target=\"_blank\">Glabna</a><a href=\"http://www.thingiverse.com/thing:1833341\" target=\"_blank\">, the </a><a href=\"http://www.thingiverse.com/thing:1833341\" target=\"_blank\">Unyielding</a><a href=\"http://www.thingiverse.com/thing:1833341\" target=\"_blank\"> Stone</a>. I am very happy with this miniature!<br /> <br /> Finally, we have one of the most bizarre and abstract of the Lodge Totems. There are many possible ways to interpret the description of <a href=\"http://www.thingiverse.com/thing:1834929\" target=\"_blank\">Zakinsuzi, the Tyrant Over Fear</a>. My design was inspired by the Avatar State used in the final episodes of Avatar: The Last Airbender. Instead of elemental rings, I used a ring of eyes and a ring of masks, as well as a snowflake and circular flame to represent Zakinzuzi's strange form in something that could easily be printed. There are certainly many other design alternative you could use, indeed this was the third iteration of my Zakinsuzi design. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b><